c_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8jnUZ8GEFPgQ7kNvwF_p9HY&_nc_oc=Admc5L3al_d0AvPqkFuXTog2Dkey3avG4QgpTlxfLkzYEtdJZhCUN2EfMUH7TGbVTHU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvOOnmE3d7QTyGt0_7c3-aP84SxazI5BIMj5AaVVVJZ6w&oe=69A6DC7D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "EmatahnCoverHiRes.png", "id": "511241218457028", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575352_511241221790361_760251907399571310_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XVZDVd7w6BYQ7kNvwG94ImK&_nc_oc=AdnkzJoU9JL7omXM_arlXTSeoR7me5Wm9nC62nslMPYt90OVjqWihf8Mvgi_zqEDWrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu7JFjo47i4KNyXPgPpIVHa8zrg1KPb3I_e2TOnwRjJPw&oe=69A6E412"}, "display_name": "Legend of the Ematahn", "keywords": ["Action", "Adventure", "Physics", "Combat", "Magic"], "long_description": "# Embark on a new adventure!\n\nAs you're beginning to make friends with a nearby village, a new group emerges that threatens the stability of the Highlands. Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?\n\n# Features\n\n* An original story with 18 unique quests.\n* A physics based combat system with magic.\n* VR climbing and platforming quests.\n* Boss fights.\n* 5 different factions with unique characters and dialog.\n* Survival mode with 6 different maps.\n* More to be added in future updates!", "short_description": "Embark on a new adventure! Legend of the Ematahn is an action adventure game featuring physics based combat, magic, an original story, and a world waiting to be explored. Complete quests for the different factions of the Highlands. Uncover a history of conflict and defend the people against threats of all kind. Are you up to the challenge?"}]}, "developer_nam